mw-audio reimplements EA audio formats based on knowledge from vgmstream
(https://github.com/vgmstream/vgmstream): the EA-XAS decoder
(ea_xas_decoder.c), the Ginsu header (meta/gin.c), the EAAudioCore/SPS
block layout (meta/ea_eaac.c, meta/ea_eaac_streamfile.h) and the EALayer3
frame layout and MPEG frame rebuild (mpeg_custom_utils_ealayer3.c, after
reverse engineering by Zench).

